  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Thịt kho is a slow-braised dish of pork belly and eggs in a glossy dark caramel sauce. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "thit-kho-caramel"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "nước hàng "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "caramel gives the dish its deep colour and slightly bitter sweetness. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This recipe serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This dish is traditionally made for "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "tet-dish"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "Tết "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "celebrations, when a large pot is made to feed the family over several days. The flavours improve overnight."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
